{"id":"00263","root":"uni00263_1","name":{"ja":"Ａ－６６・ルーナ","en":"A-66 Luna"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"Ａ－６６・ルーナ","en":"A-66 Luna"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-11-14","limited":true,"characterId":193,"profile":{"ja":"米連の最新兵器【アルテミス】を制御する為に作られた半人工生命体。６６番目にして初めて完成した。体の４０％は機械化されている。それ以外の部分は生身の人間と変わらず、生殖機能も残されているのだが、本人はそれを知らない。高い演算能力を持ち、アルテミスの制御を最優先し、戦いやその準備に特化するため、人間らしい思考や情緒は意図的に抑え込まれている。そのため感情を表に出す事はなく、淡々と振る舞う。本人に感情を抑圧されているという自覚はなく、戦うための存在である事に疑問は抱いていない。戦うために作り出されただけあって、戦場での彼女はまさに一騎当千。その強さは敵味方を問わず畏怖の対象となっている。","en":"A half-artificial lifeform created to control the United States' latest weapon, Artemis. It is the sixty-sixth unit and the first to be completed. Forty percent of its body is mechanized, while the rest remains indistinguishable from a normal human, even retaining reproductive functions—though it is unaware of this. Possessing high computational power, it prioritizes Artemis control and is specialized for combat and its preparation, deliberately suppressing human-like thought and emotion. Consequently, it never shows feelings and behaves calmly. It has no awareness that its emotions are being repressed and harbors no doubts about existing solely as a weapon of war. As a creation meant for battle, it is a one-man army on the battlefield, its strength inspiring awe in allies and enemies alike."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"魔希子","forms":[{"id":"uni00263_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[136,272],"def":[119,238],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","380001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00263_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[207,414],"def":[173,346],"spd":[73,73],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["5","380001","380002"],"evolve":[["evo00014",10],["evo00015",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00